#SKIPTEST
#chip 16F1938

'Demonstrates the NoMatchingOverload check added at build 1637 (see Change1637):
'calling Scale() with more arguments (7) than its largest overload declares (6,
'including the optional calibrate parameter) is a genuine "too many parameters"
'call that no overload can serve, so this must fail to compile with a clear error.
'#SKIPTEST above is required because this file is intentionally expected to fail -
'see NoMatchingOverload_TooManyParams_DISABLE1637_Warning.gcb for the escape-hatch
'variant that compiles.

Dim rVar As Integer
rVar = Scale(100, 0, 1023, 0, 255, 0, 999)
